/zh/ayah/51-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Adh-Dhaariyat 51:55 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sen yine de öğüt ver. Çünkü öğüt, iman edenlere fayda verir.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/51.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 55\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-55.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/51.html\">Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat</a> › Âyet 55</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat 51:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَذَكِّرْ فَإِنَّ الذِّكْرَىٰ تَنفَعُ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sen yine de öğüt ver. Çünkü öğüt, iman edenlere fayda verir.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والنفع نوعان: حصول النعمة واندفاع النقمة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/184</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا التام النافع يخص به المؤمنين المنتفعين. فهم إذا آمنوا ذكرهم بما أنزل وكلما أنزل شيء من القرآن ذكرهم به ويذكرهم بمعانيه ويذكرهم بما نزل قبل ذلك.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/163</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهو إذا بلغ قوما الرسالة فقامت الحجة عليهم ثم امتنعوا من سماع كلامه أعرض عنهم. فإن الذكرى حينئذ لا تنفع أحدا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/163</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s51a55\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/51-49.html\">Önceki âyet (51:49)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/51-56.html\">Sonraki âyet (51:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/51-56.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ben cinleri de insanları da ancak bana ibadet etsinler, diye yarattım.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ben cinleri de insanları da ancak bana ibadet etsinler, diye yarattım.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/51.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 56\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-56.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/51.html\">Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat</a> › Âyet 56</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا خَلَقْتُ الْجِنَّ وَالْإِنسَ إِلَّا لِيَعْبُدُونِ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ben cinleri de insanları da ancak bana ibadet etsinler, diye yarattım.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والإجابة والاستجابة هي طاعة الأمر والنهي وهي العبادة التي خلق لها الثقلان؛ كما قال تعالى: {وما خلقت الجن والإنس إلا ليعبدون} .<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/235</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مجاهد</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «لآمرهم وأنهاهم»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/52</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">زيد بن أسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «جبلهم على الشقاوة والسعادة»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/45</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">علي بن أبي طالب</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «إلا لآمرهم أن يعبدون وأدعوهم إلى عبادتي.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/52</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالعبادة هي الغاية التي خلق لها الجن والإنس والخلائق كلها<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/118</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنه لم يخلق الجن والإنس لحاجة منه إليهم، ولا ليربح عليهم، لكن خلقهم جودا وإحسانا ليعبدوه فيربحوا هم عليه كل الأرباح<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/135</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s51a56\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/51-55.html\">Önceki âyet (51:55)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/51-57.html\">Sonraki âyet (51:57)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/51-57.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Adh-Dhaariyat 51:57 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Onlardan bir rızık istemiyorum, beni doyurmalarını da istemiyorum.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/51-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/